    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="13" relname="span">Consistancy is one of the most important factors for all software development, including the web.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="17" relname="span">Microsoft has built its entire software empire on consistancy.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="18" relname="span">The look and feel of every product is so similar,</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="20" relname="span">one knows they are using a Microsoft application by the file menu.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="elaboration">Print is always under File.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="20" relname="elaboration">Copy is always under Edit.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="17" relname="volitional-result">This user-centric features, allowing the user to inherently know based on their mental model of the software, rather than guess, propelled Microsoft to the forefront.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="21" relname="span">As for web based interfaces, all menus for a specific website should be identical and follow convention.</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="14" relname="span">Users should never have to guess as to where to find something,</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="11" relname="condition">and if they do,</segment>
        <segment id="11" parent="15" relname="span">it should be inherently simple.</segment>
        <group id="12" type="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="12" relname="span"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="8" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="9" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="16" type="span" parent="1" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="17" type="span" parent="16" relname="span"/>
        <group id="18" type="span" parent="2" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="19" type="span" parent="3" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="20" type="span" parent="19" relname="span"/>
        <group id="21" type="span" parent="13" relname="elaboration"/>
    </body>
</rst>
